{"id":"01a0657e-1347-710e-a99f-d79ff2eaa5ac","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":653,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"“Desais Cotton. [Weaver-Chancellor]. Why was I summoned?”"}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-7190-94c2-f31c17fede75","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":660,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"Desais Cotton spoke crisply. Yvlon exhaled. At last. She nodded, smiling."}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-7599-a79f-1f58516ce82a","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":694,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"Pure blue, edging towards white. Desais sighed and closed her eyes. Yvlon worked her mouth."}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-7074-acf7-f74b0fd9fd14","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":708,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"She went silent a third time as Desais slashed her hand and Yvlon’s mouth closed. Yvlon’s third mistake was threatening the [Weaver-Chancellor] with the immediate consequences of not helping her. Desais looked at Yvlon and came to a speedy decision."}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-769a-9bb5-9da76b3ab59d","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":715,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"Desais looked uneasy. She glanced at Yvlon."}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-75b5-ad4a-ec93f8cc0cce","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":726,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"The others nodded fervently as Yvlon glowered at them. Desais clicked her tongue."}
{"id":"01a0657e-1347-7a6a-9481-6adc66bc2520","chapterSlug":"rw8-22 HE","paragraph":728,"wording":"[Chancellor]","event":"named","holderQuote":"They hadn’t corrected that lie. Yvlon tried to speak again as Desais rubbed at her face."}
